 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "Brand-new kitchen countertops starting at $1,995.",
   "t0": 0.0,
   "t1": 3.74
  },
  {
   "id": "b1",
   "text": "Most countertop companies will quote you thousands more than that.",
   "t0": 4.72,
   "t1": 7.74
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "text": "Right?",
   "t0": 7.84,
   "t1": 8.04
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "text": "Well, sort of.",
   "t0": 8.34,
   "t1": 9.44
  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "text": "It comes down to the size of your kitchen and the material you pick.",
   "t0": 9.62,
   "t1": 12.46
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "text": "But here's the thing.",
   "t0": 12.68,
   "t1": 13.34
  },
  {
   "id": "b6",
   "text": "There's a fair price.",
   "t0": 13.46,
   "t1": 14.4
  },
  {
   "id": "b7",
   "text": "And then there's pricing so marked up, I don't know how some of these guys sleep at night.",
   "t0": 14.72,
   "t1": 18.44
  },
  {
   "id": "b8",
   "text": "At GC Countertops, here's how we do it.",
   "t0": 18.6,
   "t1": 20.74
  },
  {
   "id": "b9",
   "text": "First, we do amazing work.",
   "t0": 20.9,
   "t1": 22.64
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "text": "No corner cutting.",
   "t0": 22.98,
   "t1": 23.66
  },
  {
   "id": "b11",
   "text": "And because we source our countertops directly from the supplier, we get contractor pricing that you can't get on your own, and we pass that savings right on to you.",
   "t0": 23.96,
   "t1": 31.46
  },
  {
   "id": "b12",
   "text": "We take out your old countertops and install your new ones, with all the labor included.",
   "t0": 31.72,
   "t1": 35.52
  },
  {
   "id": "b13",
   "text": "And we don't leave your home until you're 100% happy with the work.",
   "t0": 35.82,
   "t1": 39.02
  },
  {
   "id": "cta",
   "text": "Click \"Get Quote\" to book your free in-home measurement and estimate. We'll give you a fair, honest price, with no pressure.",
   "t0": 39.32,
   "t1": 45.12
  }
 ]
}